# NOTE: google-services.json and GoogleService-Info.plist are NOT secrets.
# They are safe to commit per Google's own documentation.
# They are committed so EAS Build can include them in Android/iOS builds.
# **/google-services.json   <-- intentionally NOT ignored
# **/GoogleService-Info.plist  <-- intentionally NOT ignored

